#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: lightweight-share-buttons.php:3
msgid "Lightweight Share Buttons"
msgstr "Letvægts-delingsknapper"

#. Description of the plugin
#: lightweight-share-buttons.php:4
msgid "A lightweight, privacy-friendly social sharing block with native share and copy-link support."
msgstr "En let og privatlivsvenlig blok med sociale delingsknapper, systemdeling og kopiering af link."

#. Author of the plugin
