#: src/index.js:114
msgid "Used by Native Share, WhatsApp, email, Telegram, X, Bluesky, and Threads. Facebook and LinkedIn do not accept a custom message; Reddit uses only the title and URL."
msgstr "Bruges af Systemdeling, WhatsApp, e-mail, Telegram, X, Bluesky og Threads. Facebook og LinkedIn accepterer ikke en brugerdefineret besked; Reddit bruger kun titlen og URL-adressen."

